#: templates/console/plan_edit.html:15
msgid "%(count)s عميل على هذه الباقة"
msgstr "%(count)s clients on this plan"

#: templates/console/plan_edit.html:25
msgid ""
"%(count)s عميل على هذه الباقة الآن. تغيير الخصائص أو الحدود يسري عليهم "
"<strong>فورًا</strong>؛ تغيير السعر يُسجَّل فقط ولا يُغيّر ما يدفعونه اليوم."
msgstr ""
"%(count)s clients are on this plan right now. Changing its features or "
"limits applies to them <strong>immediately</strong>; changing its price is "
"only recorded, and does not change what they pay today."

